    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d63">

                <pb facs="0164" n="52" sameAs="frus:frus1918/pg52"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 832.73/125</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Brazil</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Morgan</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1047</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Rio de Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-11-08">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 8, 1917</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to the Embassy despatch No. 998
                    of August 16 last, relative to the act of the Brazilian Government in granting a
                    concession to the Central &amp; South American Telegraph Co. to land submarine
                    cables at Rio de Janeiro and Santos coming from the Argentine Republic, I have
                    the honor to enclose a single copy of an English translation of the Executive
                    decree No. 12,599 of August 11 which conceded the concession. Further copies
                    will be transmitted as soon as they are furnished the Embassy by the
                    representative of the company.</p>
                <p>The contract between the Minister of Public Works and the local representative of
                    the company was signed on October 27 and the contract published in the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Official Gazette</hi> of November 1, 1917.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Edwin V. Morgan</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d63-a1.xml" xpointer="d63-a1"/>
            </div>
